{"id":"0d8969c7b834f5a6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-external-logic.md","title":"对象理论的外部经典定理与后承","display":"df-external-logic — 对象理论的外部经典定理与后承","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-external-logic","aliases":["91-df-external-logic"],"display":"df-external-logic — 对象理论的外部经典定理与后承","depends_on":["[[91-df-internal-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-external-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-external-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-external-logic — 对象理论的外部经典定理与后承"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9f50803c6dbd04e\" href=\"?note=c9f50803c6dbd04e\" title=\"91-df-internal-logic\">91-df-internal-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是在经典逻辑中公理化的真理理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 为有限句子集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Ext}(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Ext}(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash^{S}_{\\rm Ext}\\varphi\\quad\\coloneqq\\quad\nS\\vdash\\left[\\bigwedge_{\\delta\\in\\Delta}\\delta\\to\\varphi\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\vdash^{S}_{\\rm Ext}\\varphi\\quad\\coloneqq\\quad\nS\\vdash\\left[\\bigwedge_{\\delta\\in\\Delta}\\delta\\to\\varphi\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书“外部逻辑”是 KF、FS 等公理系统直接使用的逻辑，不是元理论的三值模型观察。\n旧版把三值固定点真句集命名为外部逻辑，实际倒置了内外区别。经典 KF 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\lor\\neg\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\lor\\neg\\lambda\\)</span>，但不证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\lor\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\lor\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>；FS 的两条定理规则使内部定理集与外部定理集相同。</p>\n<p>来源：第 20 章，尤其 §20.2，印刷页 281–285，PDF 页 292–296。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-internal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"c9f50803c6dbd04e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Ext}(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}:S\\vdash\\varphi\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta\\vdash^{S}_{\\rm Ext}\\varphi\\quad\\coloneqq\\quad\nS\\vdash\\left[\\bigwedge_{\\delta\\in\\Delta}\\delta\\to\\varphi\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda\\lor\\neg\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\lor\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1232,"backlinks":[{"id":"f28d9b3f22314622","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":